==English==

===Etymology===
{{bor|en|la|[[dēlīrium]] [[tremēns]]|lit=trembling madness}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|head=delirium tremens}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A [[psychosis]] of chronic [[alcoholism]], usually due to [[alcohol]] withdrawal, which can be fatal. Symptoms include sweating, tremors, terrifying [[hallucination]]s, [[insomnia]], restlessness, [[disorientation]] and anxiety.
#: {{syn|en|DT}}

